# CJK, accented and emoji text, in an inbox project named after an emoji, are added and saved as typed.
file <<END
📥 INBOX: @inbox
	- 既存
END
keys q
see Quick Add → 📥 INBOX
type 牛乳を買う café 👍🏽 tomorrow
keys <Enter>
see - 牛乳を買う café
quit
saved <<END
📥 INBOX: @inbox
	- 既存
	- 牛乳を買う café 👍🏽 @start({today+1})
END
